        {
          "text": "Ndũkaakũĩĩsya kyambo kya mũvaka wa mũtũi waku, kĩla ala ma tene meekĩie, ũtiĩwanĩ waku ũla ũkatiĩwa, nthĩ ĩla Yeova Ngai waku ũkũnengae ũmĩmesye. ",
